<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Blood Donation Platform</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        color: #2b2d42;
      }
      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 0;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 36px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        border-top: 5px solid #d90429;
      }
      .header-logo {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .header-logo h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #d90429;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .welcome-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d90429 0%, #ef233c 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .welcome-banner h2 {
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        font-size: 22px;
      }
      .welcome-banner p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffddd2;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .feature-list {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border-left: 4px solid #d90429;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .feature-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .feature-item:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .feature-icon {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-right: 12px;
      }
      .feature-text {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #2d3748;
      }
      .cta-box {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 32px 0 16px 0;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        background-color: #d90429;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(217, 4, 41, 0.3);
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 32px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a0aec0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="header-logo">
          <h1>🩸 Blood Donation & Emergency Platform</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="welcome-banner">
          <h2>Welcome to the Lifesaving Community!</h2>
          <p>Together, we bridge the gap between donors and patients in emergency need.</p>
        </div>

        <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
        <p>Welcome aboard! Your account has been registered successfully as a <strong><%= role %></strong>.</p>

        <div class="feature-list">
          <div class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🔍</span>
            <span class="feature-text"><strong>Real-time Donor Discovery:</strong> Instantly match compatible blood donors based on blood group and location.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🚨</span>
            <span class="feature-text"><strong>Emergency Alerts:</strong> Create or respond to critical blood requests with urgency prioritization.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🛡️</span>
            <span class="feature-text"><strong>Safety & Eligibility:</strong> Automated 90-day donation cooldown tracking for donor health.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Log in to your account today to update your profile, adjust your donor availability, or submit blood requests.</p>

        <div class="cta-box">
          <a href="http://localhost:3000/login" class="cta-button">Go to Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blood Donation & Emergency Assistance Platform. All rights reserved.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
